Trademarks and derivation. The image replaces Fedora's fedora-logos package
with generic-logos from the Fedora Project's repositories, as Fedora's
trademark guidelines ask of a system derived from Fedora; its RPM states its
licence as GPL-2.0-only AND LicenseRef-Callaway-LGPLv2+. The image also
replaces Bazzite's logo files with the Cairn mark, replaces the boot splash
with Cairn's own, and rewrites os-release to name Cairn Linux. It builds the
initramfs again with that os-release, so a computer with no hostname of its
own is called cairn, and its boot menu says Cairn Linux. Fedora is a
